     "<p>ICPSR Summer Workshop, &quot;<a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/22KJvC2mY7Gra2NcCv-gUl7mufrnbCzcIUBTd3rUYsG-5Sov7jgFrZnOBOMkAKgVVGrIfCprFvMT0of_-h7-HEupzLWKoUqBhDEh7X5ixua9e2xxJ-bWch5aI9kyVl_hQNiB0lhTQntfc7uAsfauTQbjJi2TbiGjZqv9s4zmLHPHmqPuC__;!!HXCxUKc!3S3tXZMTsU1cP7ePkMICgdlS4MeejSXf8A4BQI6zj0wi83pqhv0Vdj2wUwGl_wHv6WXtd5URIIp0GkXSADU$\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/22KJvC2mY7Gra2NcCv-gUl7mufrnbCzcIUBTd3rUYsG-5Sov7jgFrZnOBOMkAKgVVGrIfCprFvMT0of_-h7-HEupzLWKoUqBhDEh7X5ixua9e2xxJ-bWch5aI9kyVl_hQNiB0lhTQntfc7uAsfauTQbjJi2TbiGjZqv9s4zmLHPHmqPuC__;!!HXCxUKc!3S3tXZMTsU1cP7ePkMICgdlS4MeejSXf8A4BQI6zj0wi83pqhv0Vdj2wUwGl_wHv6WXtd5URIIp0GkXSADU$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244438589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ic0nEfp7VOLTBshB7_-a7\">Sensitivity\r\nAnalysis: Quantifying the Robustness of Inferences to Alternative Factors or\r\nData</a>,&quot; July 8-12, 2024. Hybrid (virtual, FtF in Ann Arbor, MI, with\r\nasynchronous access to materials).</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most social scientists need to consider the unobserved\r\nconditions that could change an inference. This workshop is about the\r\nstatistical tools (R,  Stata or the <a href=\"https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://konfound-project.shinyapps.io/konfound-it/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244438589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UKQxz3GguBUaLFlLLoSTW\">konfound-it app</a>)\r\nto do just that, quantifying the strength of evidence to inform policy,\r\npractice, or general social science.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This workshop is a full 20 instruction hours\r\nelaborating on the Mar 21 talk “Sensitivity Analysis for Quantifying the\r\nRobustness of Causal Inference” given by <a href=\"https://education.msu.edu/people/frank-kenneth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://education.msu.edu/people/frank-kenneth/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244438589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20_QhORk5TWoPqdEqxXmxu\">Ken Frank</a>. </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Go here to <a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/2xSc-y_ytf03yTwxHV1PTUd5gIu9CbqU4EFhexiF9QOq9Sov7jgGxjfUBcL4GUEwN753fOzVj8Akf7efB07AmJfFho-IYgRsFc8NMVUpehSfprHVgHICUWFVhrSD4y2t8KfOduYW8jyTYoqmi0Tej9dx4ztUdwSmEUMyN5bqAiF_1i7efjr7YRtGb7JfYkhCUrfTdwHdcdFXuiQay7t4t-OE-EvKzIJHEDB0TMOdEJrQWZ0u_v4SA70s5UTP3nNIaNdn39E6Ge6U_NSbLJ7w310t874zVeg__;!!HXCxUKc!3S3tXZMTsU1cP7ePkMICgdlS4MeejSXf8A4BQI6zj0wi83pqhv0Vdj2wUwGl_wHv6WXtd5URIIp0uyWIQ7k$\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/umich-dot-yamm-track.appspot.com/2xSc-y_ytf03yTwxHV1PTUd5gIu9CbqU4EFhexiF9QOq9Sov7jgGxjfUBcL4GUEwN753fOzVj8Akf7efB07AmJfFho-IYgRsFc8NMVUpehSfprHVgHICUWFVhrSD4y2t8KfOduYW8jyTYoqmi0Tej9dx4ztUdwSmEUMyN5bqAiF_1i7efjr7YRtGb7JfYkhCUrfTdwHdcdFXuiQay7t4t-OE-EvKzIJHEDB0TMOdEJrQWZ0u_v4SA70s5UTP3nNIaNdn39E6Ge6U_NSbLJ7w310t874zVeg__;!!HXCxUKc!3S3tXZMTsU1cP7ePkMICgdlS4MeejSXf8A4BQI6zj0wi83pqhv0Vdj2wUwGl_wHv6WXtd5URIIp0uyWIQ7k$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244438589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tIuuMHpaMa8lQu4gLVErC\">register</a>. Group <a href=\"https://www.icpsr.umich.edu/web/pages/sumprog/registration.html#:~:text=Discount%20for%20Returning%20ICPSR%20Summer,this%20year&amp;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.icpsr.umich.edu/web/pages/sumprog/registration.html%23:~:text%3DDiscount%2520for%2520Returning%2520ICPSR%2520Summer,this%2520year%26&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244438589000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09tOIyzTQmp-4FJjdnvhCp\">discounts</a> available as well.</p>"
